<mxCell id="i45" value="Llama 3&#x27;s report sized the 405B with a fit and warned: fits predict next-token loss, not a benchmark, and small-budget fits are noisy. “Emergent” jumps can be the scoring rule (Schaeffer et al., 2023). Inverse scaling (McKenzie et al., 2023): bigger can score lower, and some tasks turn U-shaped — score the size you serve." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="424" width="820" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
